**
** Moore and Teixeira-Dias (2025), "Target 2": Al2024 sphere (4 mm) at 7 km/s on an NbC/Al2024 bumper,
** adaptive FEM->SPH conversion, ONE user material (vumat_hvi.f) for the three bodies.
** Keyword skeleton: the full deck has 2.7 M nodes and 2.4 M C3D8R elements (293 MB, above
** GitHub's 100 MB limit). Node, element and set lists longer than 40 lines are cut after the
** first 3 lines; every keyword, material constant, section, conversion control, contact,
** step and output request is as in the run. Rebuild the mesh from the dimensions in README.
